stateDiagram-v2
  direction LR
  [*] --> ASSIGNED : ambulance assigned
  ASSIGNED --> EN_ROUTE : crew starts
  ASSIGNED --> CANCELLED : incident cancelled / closed
  EN_ROUTE --> ON_SCENE : arrived
  EN_ROUTE --> CANCELLED : patient cancels
  ON_SCENE --> TRANSPORTING : hospital selected
  ON_SCENE --> NO_TRANSPORT : treated on scene
  TRANSPORTING --> AT_HOSPITAL : arrived at hospital
  AT_HOSPITAL --> HANDED_OVER : hand over (record locked)
  HANDED_OVER --> [*]
  NO_TRANSPORT --> [*]
  CANCELLED --> [*]
  note right of ON_SCENE : vital signs can be recorded in ON_SCENE, TRANSPORTING and AT_HOSPITAL
